
Machine-only GIT secrets for `sequence-site.sh` — **do not push** contents to GitHub.

Put this **on the Pi** as **`/etc/sequence/git.env`**, **`chmod 640`**, **`chown root:pi`**:

GITHUB_TOKEN=

Or:

GIT_USERNAME=

GIT_PASSWORD=

Reload by restarting **`sequence-site.service`**.

Same vars as **`deploy/raspberry-pi/.env.example`**, plus **`checkout/.env`** in the repo (gitignored).

Priority if both exist: **`…/Sequence_iOS/.env`**, then **`/etc/sequence/git.env`** (later overrides).
